      }
    ],
    "summary": "A unit has every keyword of its models, and an [attached unit](vsdata:core-rule/attached-units) every keyword of its component units, only while the models with those keywords are still in it: a destroyed model stops adding its keywords to its former unit.\n\nFor example, if the Aspiring Sorcerer of a Rubric Marines unit is destroyed and no model left in the unit has the **PSYKER** keyword, the unit loses **PSYKER**.",
